solution:
**Given:**

sin theta = (43)/(47)

**Formula Used:**

cot theta = (cos theta)/(sin theta)

cos theta = sqrt{1 - sin² theta}

**Calculation:**

⇒ sin theta = (43)/(47)

⇒ cos theta = sqrt{1 - ((43)/(47))²}

⇒ cos theta = sqrt{1 - (1849)/(2209)}

⇒ cos theta = sqrt{(2209 - 1849)/(2209)}

⇒ cos theta = sqrt{(360)/(2209)}

⇒ cos theta = frac{6sqrt{10}}{47}

⇒ cot theta = frac{frac{6sqrt{10}}{47}}{(43)/(47)}

⇒ cot theta = frac{6 sqrt{10}}{43}

**∴ The value of cot θ is frac{6 sqrt{10}}{43}.**
